MyGameStudio skill: gdd-gamestudio
Part of MyGameStudio 3.0.0 -- a native Agent Skills library for game
development. Copyright (c) 2026 LC-86 / MyGameStudio.

This skill is original to MyGameStudio; it has no counterpart in the
upstream skills repository. It interoperates with methods that are
adapted from Matt Pocock's skills.

This notice travels with the skill so that a single-skill install still
carries the required copyright and permission notices.

